# 0.17.2.261112
  - fix handling range and match in getVehicles, in case of fetch
  - fix chache handling for deleted vehicles > maxAge = reload true
  - fix age handling in getBuildingCategories

# 0.17.1.261110
- Fixed single-building vehicle fetches to use the building-specific fallback endpoint and avoid
  clearing the full vehicle store during a building-only reload.
- Corrected cached age checks for building categories and made cached metadata reads safer when
  values are absent.

# 0.17.0.261110
- Added building-scoped vehicle fetching and vehicle-category caching; reworked vehicle cache
  refresh and update handling.

# 0.16.6.261031
- Refined building and vehicle retrieval with optional result predicates, small-building mapping,
  and consistent filtering of cache metadata from returned records.

# 0.16.0.261026
- Added cached retrieval of LSS Manager building categories.

# 0.15.5.261024
- Improved incremental building and vehicle updates using stored timestamps and expanded indexed
  queries with optional result filtering.

# 0.15.4.261019
- Updated fetch and cache handling for paginated building and vehicle data, including API fallback
  behavior and cached type metadata.

# 0.15.4.261012
- Integrated the fetch and IndexedDB helpers into the current library structure for buildings,
  vehicles, building and vehicle types, small-building mappings, and mission types.

# 0.0.4.261012.1927
- Initial API-fetch library with paginated building and vehicle requests, IndexedDB caching, and
  cached building, vehicle, and mission metadata.